ting the network.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>They build visually appealing and fully functional websites to meet specific business goals and targets. With the increasing use of mobile devices, the demand for web development is also growing rapidly. The web development future holds ample emerging technologies and trends that will define the industry.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The process comprises various fundamental components, which we have discussed below:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Frontend Development- <\/strong>It is the client side of a website that focuses on the user interface and appearance of a website. Designing the interface requires the knowledge of various <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/front-end-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">frontend languages<\/a>, such as <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HTML<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CSS<\/a>, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a>, which are used to structure web pages, add features, and style them.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Backend Development- <\/strong>This deals with designing the server-side of a website, including backend logic and infrastructure that powers websites. Backend development involves writing code, setting up databases, managing data storage, and handling user authentication.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Full-stack Development- <\/strong>It combines both frontend and backend of a website, i.e., end-to-end solutions of a web development project. Full-stack development demands knowledge of client-side and server-side technologies to create different components, right from the user interface to the database.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Database- <\/strong>It is used to store, retrieve, and manipulate data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Web Design- <\/strong>It involves designing a website&#8217;s layout, typography, and other visual elements. Designers implement different graphic design principles to enhance the user experience and usability of a website. <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-design-vs-web-development\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Web design and web development<\/a> are two different concepts where the former involves designing visual elements, while the latter comprises designing, creating, testing, and maintaining frontend and backend elements.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/web-devlopment.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>Full Stack Development Course with AI Engineering<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (24922)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 27000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 20 Week